が、ゴーグルはただの保護用のものです。\n\n右の腰に下げている鞄には調査したものを記すためのノートとインクとペンなど筆記用具が入っています。\n持ち物は上記カバンの他に後ろにも小さいバッグと短刀を所有してます。\n主に戦闘は打刀で行いますが、短刀も使用したり戦闘以外にも調査に使ったりもします。\n\n基本的に自由に書いていただいて構いません楽しみにしています", "nc": 145, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}], "similar_creators": [{"id": 2132422, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": true, "name": "すんなな", "screen_name": "sn77of", "avatar_url": "https://proxy.misskeyusercontent.jp/avatar.webp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.misskeyusercontent.jp%2Fio%2Fwebpublic-6f1c9440-26a5-47ca-a6f2-a4389d1fbc73.webp&avatar=1", "header_url": "https://media.misskeyusercontent.jp/io/webpublic-c648555f-e96b-4162-a13f-5d0136124aa9.webp?sensitive=true", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "complete_expiration_days": 60, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}, {"genre": "comic"}, {"genre": "correction"}], "banned": false, "nc": 144}, {"id": 2241442, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": true, "acceptable": false, "name": "にゃか", "screen_name": "nyaka_e", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1745717465190109184/rafavhU9.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1553186486136471553/1696593809/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 3, "complete_expiration_days": 90, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}], "banned": false, "nc": 176}, {"id": 2452063, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": true, "name": "鳶町ジョア", "screen_name": "Joa_tobimachi", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1946571946323304448/r03ATap8.jpg", "header_url": null, "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at